# smoke.vrs: proves vrclient can join the dev server, run .uriel commands as admin and read the replies.
# Needs: the dev server running with Uriel and DevChatEcho; Chaos in adminlist.txt.
ensure
console TPHome
wait 3
mark
chat .uriel api version
expect-reply [URIEL:
chat .uriel unit list
expect-reply Uriel units
shot full smoke
